  "body_text": "幸福降临的太突然\n居然俺们也有包场了\n今日（6.23）下午2点后，浦东店（芳华路139号）仅提供外卖小窗口服务哦\n给您安排好来小憩的出行计划带来不便，敬请谅解哈！\n另外，\n端午节（6.25）法定假日照旧店休一天\n哦\n买豆子，上小程序，可快递，也可门店自提（备注就好）\n感谢大家伙的支持！",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          幸福降临的太突然\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          居然俺们也有包场了\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">\n          今日（6.23）下午2点后，浦东店（芳华路139号）仅提供外卖小窗口服务哦\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          给您安排好来小憩的出行计划带来不便，敬请谅解哈！\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          另外，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(120, 172, 254);\">\n          端午节（6.25）法定假日照旧店休一天\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          哦\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RFJ3eGXaJic2nISa7ewwqibZpRfIYwnnX9Gzv3sSGiaab0wTDPdqRj3kIY2Bq6bwwo3xw7B8nFymZIw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          买豆子，上小程序，可快递，也可门店自提（备注就好）\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          感谢